      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KODA (4) doesn't win out of turn but looks close to breaking through. Has hit the frame the last two runs, the latest when second (19.74) at Healesville. Solid record at the distance winning two races. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Well-placed to take this out. DELIGHTFUL RAIN (2) has been a little hard to follow, finishing out of the placings latest but was in winning form two back scoring in a Bottom Up - Restricted Win at this track. Can feature with the right run. INFLECTION POINT (5) doesn't win out of turn. Finished second (24.43) at Bendigo latest and might be close to finding winning form again. Form at the trip sound including two wins. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Must be included in calculations. MISS RODRIGO (1) is worth a look over a shorter distance this time.",
